WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:07.886
Actual strength: eighty-eight thousand seven hundred and fifteen personnel against an authorized strength of one hundred and one thousand five hundred.

00:00:07.886 --> 00:00:11.477
A shortfall of twelve thousand seven hundred and eighty-five.

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:15.625
Basic training throughput is capped at six thousand four hundred recruits per year.

00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:20.306
Five thousand twenty-six personnel departed in 2024-25 alone.

00:00:20.306 --> 00:00:25.806
Seventy-six percent of CAF occupations are more than ten percent short of authorized strength.

00:00:25.806 --> 00:00:35.931
Twelve NATO nations conducted live-agent chemical, biological, radiological, and nuclear training at CFB Suffield under Exercise Precise Response in June 2025.

00:00:35.931 --> 00:00:42.374
Over two thousand Canadian Armed Forces personnel remain on constant rotation in Latvia under Operation Reassurance.

00:00:42.374 --> 00:00:47.943
General Jennie Carignan was appointed Chief of the Defence Staff on July 18th, 2024.

00:00:47.943 --> 00:00:55.522
Christiane Fox was appointed Deputy Minister in December 2025 — despite documented ethics violations at IRCC.

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:59.284
The command structure is staffed, but the force it commands is hollowed out.
